Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the absence of proper clock source definitions for the SP804 timers, which relied on the SP810 system controller to provide the necessary clock frequencies (1MHz and 32kHz). Without these definitions, the SP804 timers could not function correctly, leading to issues with clock frequency selection and timer operation on the ARM64 architecture.

